ard\ql \li1859\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 What is spreadsheet? List any two jobs that it can do. \par\pard\qj \li1799\ri1818\sb261\sl-280\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 A spreadsheet is a grid that organizes data into columns and rows. Spreadsheets make it \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 easy to display information, and people can insert formulas to work with the data. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1799\sb8\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 Electronic replacement for ledgers \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 Charts \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb1\sl-256\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 Financial-forecasting. \par\pard\li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0\par\pard\li1799\sb24\sl-276\slmult0\fi0\tx3693 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf9\f10\fs24 Question No: 34\tab \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 (Marks: 2)\par\pard\li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0\fi0 \up0 \expndtw-1\charscalex100 In JavaScript, what is event handling? What are the two types of events?\par\pard\li1799\sb274\sl-276\slmult0\fi0 \up0 \expndtw-1\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 In JavaScript capturing events and responding to them is event handling.   The system\par\pard\li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0\fi0 \up0 \expndtw-1\charscalex100 sends events to the program and the program responds to them as they arrive.\par\pard\li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0\fi0\tx2339 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 1.\tab \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 Events can include things a user does - like clicking the mouse.\par\pard\li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0\fi0\tx2339 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 2.\tab \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 Events that the system itself does - like updating the clock.\par\pard\ql \li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1799\sb262\sl-276\slmult0\tx3693 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf9\f10\fs24 Question No: 35 \tab \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 ( Marks: 3 ) \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 Explain how many ways businesses monitor their employees? \par\pard\qj \li1799\sb0\sl-260\slmult0 \par\pard\qj\li1799\ri1768\sb38\sl-260\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 \u8226? Systems are available that monitor almost every key stroke that an employee makes on \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 a computer. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb7\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \u8226? Systems are available that read and censor all incoming and outgoing eMail. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \u8226? It is quite straight forward to monitor where you surf the web. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1799\sb8\sl-276\slmult0\tx3693 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf9\f10\fs24 Question No: 36 \tab \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 ( Marks: 3 ) \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb1\sl-256\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 What is difference between Design and System Architecture? \par\pard\ql \li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb172\sl-287\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex110 \ul0\nosupersub\cf6\f7\fs25 Note\ul0\nosupersub\cf7\f8\fs25 : Solve these papers by yourself \par\pard\ql \li2702\sb74\sl-287\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex108 This VU Group is not responsible for any solved content \par\pard\sect\sectd\fs24\paperw12240\paperh15840{\shp
