hat guidelines \line\up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 should be adopted to troubleshoot with malicious software? (6 marks) \par\pard\qj \li1799\ri1609\sb261\sl-280\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 Trojan horses are stand-alone programs. The look like what they are not and appear to be \up0 \expndtw-1\charscalex100 something interesting and harmless (e.g. a game) there execution results in destruction. \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 Worms only make copies of themselves on the infected computer. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1799\sb8\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 Following guidelines should be adopted to troubleshoot with malicious software: \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb264\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \u8226? Download SW from trusted sites only. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \u8226? Do not open attachments of unsolicited eMails. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \u8226? Use floppy disks and CDROMs that have been used in trusted computers only. \par\pard\qj \li1799\ri2461\sb18\sl-260\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 \u8226? When transferring files from your computer to another, use the write-protection \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 notches. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb7\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \u8226? Stay away from pirated SW. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \u8226? Regularly back your data up. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \u8226? Install Antivirus SW; keep it and its virus definitions updated. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb264\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf9\f10\fs24 b) Which part of a virus consists of malicious computer instructions? (2 marks) \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 Payload is the part of virus that generally consists of malicious computer instructions. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1799\sb8\sl-276\slmult0\tx3693 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf9\f10\fs24 Question No: 31 \tab \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 ( Marks: 1 ) \par\pard\ql \li1859\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 What is the function of Network Interface Card? \par\pard\qj \li1799\ri1610\sb261\sl-280\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 NIC is an I/O device that plugs into the computer and it enables it to communicate over a \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 network. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1799\sb8\sl-276\slmult0\tx3693 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf9\f10\fs24 Question No: 32 \tab \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 (Marks: 1) \par\pard\ql \li1859\sb1\sl-256\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 In programming, what is a loop? \par\pard\ql \li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb32\sl-287\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex108 \ul0\nosupersub\cf6\f7\fs25 Note\ul0\nosupersub\cf7\f8\fs25 : Solve these papers by yourself \par\pard\ql \li2702\sb74\sl-287\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex106 This VU Group is not responsible for any solved content \par\pard\sect\sectd\fs24\paperw12240\paperh15840{\shp
