}}}}}\pard\sb0\sl-240{\bkmkstart Pg10}{\bkmkend Pg10}\par\pard\ql \li5521\sb0\sl-322\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li5521\sb172\sl-322\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf1\f2\fs28 Composed \par\pard\ql \li4859\sb0\sl-320\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf2\f3\fs28 Hafiz Salman Majeed \par\pard\ql \li5030\sb1\sl-319\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf3\f4\fs28 www.vuaskari.com \par\pard\ql \li4886\sb1\sl-319\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-6\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf4\f5\fs28 Solved By\u8221?Mehreen\u8221? \par\pard\qj \li1799\ri2492\sb274\sl-280\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 A loop is a programming language statement which allows code to be repeatedly \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 executed. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb1\sl-255\slmult0\tx3693 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf9\f10\fs24 Question No: 33 \tab \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 (Marks: 2) \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb8\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 What is an intelligent system? \par\pard\qj \li1799\sb0\sl-280\slmult0 \par\pard\qj\li1799\ri1918\sb1\sl-280\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 Intelligent system is a SW programs or SW/HW systems designed to perform complex \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 tasks employing strategies that mimic some aspect of human thought. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb264\sl-276\slmult0\tx3693 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf9\f10\fs24 Question No: 34 \tab \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 (Marks: 2 ) \par\pard\ql \li1859\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 Why hub is used in networks? \par\pard\qj \li1799\sb0\sl-273\slmult0 \par\pard\qj\li1799\ri1610\sb14\sl-273\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-1\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 Hub is networking equipment and a device which connects several computers to form a \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex100 network. In a network the NIC translates the message into electrical pulses suitable for \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 the computer network in use & transmits it to the hub through the cable. The hub receives \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 them and forwards them to all computers connected to it. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1799\sb9\sl-276\slmult0\tx3693 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf9\f10\fs24 Question No: 35 \tab \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 ( Marks: 3 ) \par\pard\ql \li1859\sb1\sl-256\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 What are Trojan Horses? \par\pard\qj \li1799\sb0\sl-280\slmult0 \par\pard\qj\li1799\ri1610\sb5\sl-280\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 Trojan Horses are unlike viruses, they are stand-alone programs. The look like what they \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex100 are not. They appear to be something interesting and harmless (e.g. a game) but when \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 their execution result in destruction. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb264\sl-276\slmult0\tx3693 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf9\f10\fs24 Question No: 36 \tab \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 (Marks: 3) \par\pard\ql \li1859\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 Elaborate with examples Vector or Object oriented graphics. \par\pard\qj \li1799\sb0\sl-270\slmult0 \par\pard\qj\li1799\ri1610\sb19\sl-270\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 Vector or Object-Oriented Graphics treats everything that is drawn as an object. Objects \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex107 retain their identity after they are drawn. These objects can later be easily moved, \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 stretched, duplicated, deleted, etc \par\pard\qj \li1799\ri4325\sb2\sl-280\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 They are resolution independent and relatively small file size. \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 Examples: swf, svg, wmf, ps. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb264\sl-276\slmult0\tx3693 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf9\f10\fs24 Question No: 37 \tab \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 (Marks: 3) \par\pard\ql \li1859\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 How can you define a consistent web design? Why is it needed? \par\pard\qj \li1799\ri1608\sb7\sl-273\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 A consistent web design should be the one that achieves the result that it was designed \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex104 for, that result can only be achieved by giving the user what he wants, as quickly as \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 possible, without her/him expending much effort. One definition of usability: Let the user \up0 \expndtw-4\charscalex100 have what he wants, quickly, without much effort \u8220?Quickly\u8221? is important! \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb0\sl-276\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li1799\sb9\sl-276\slmult0\tx3693 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf9\f10\fs24 Question No: 39 \tab \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 (Marks: 5) \par\pard\ql \li1859\sb4\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 What are the advantages of multimedia presentations? Write any five. \par\pard\ql \li1799\sb264\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 Following are the advantages of multimedia presentations: \par\pard\ql \li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb28\sl-287\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex108 \ul0\nosupersub\cf6\f7\fs25 Note\ul0\nosupersub\cf7\f8\fs25 : Solve these papers by yourself \par\pard\ql \li2702\sb74\sl-287\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex106 This VU Group is not responsible for any solved content \par\pard\sect\sectd\fs24\paperw12240\paperh15840{\shp
