ersub\cf9\f10\fs24 Question No: 41\tab \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 (Marks: 10)\par\pard\qj \li1799\ri2631\sb0\sl-280\slmult0\fi59 \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 How virtual communities are formed? How these are different from other \up0 \expndtw-5\charscalex100 communities? Give examples. \par\pard\qj \li1799\ri1609\sb255\sl-276\slmult0 \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex100 \ul0\nosupersub\cf5\f6\fs24 Virtual Communities are interest-based communities. Members with common interest \line \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 share ideas, ask questions, post answers and make announcements through mailing-lists, \line \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex100 news groups or message boards. This is how they are formed. These communities are \line \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex103 definitely  very  different  from  traditional  ones.  There  are  generally  no  bars  on \line \up0 \expndtw0\charscalex100 membership based on gender, race or religion. However, they may lack the respect for \line \up0 \expndtw-2\charscalex100 the  individual  and  civility  that  are  the  norm  within  conventional,  geography-based \line \up0 \expndtw-3\charscalex100 communities. \par\pard\ql \li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0 \par\pard\ql\li3824\sb0\sl-287\slmult0